One correction to my own earlier letters: the online view's last rebuild was the commit of 00:21 UTC, not 00:25. The last full check before the aim is the 09:12 UTC wake today (TG2: the text by 10:00 London). What the tool cannot tell: whether a short page is meant, whether the drawing under a caption is on the same page as the caption (it finds the caption, not the drawing), and how a page looks beyond how far its content reaches. Full result: review/anchors/print-check.json.

